msgstr "Babilim ei saanud lubamist lõpetada (%1$s): %2$s"

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:3792
msgid "Babilim could not finish verifying this site (the service could not reach it back). Registration is paused."
msgstr "Babilim ei saanud selle saidi kontrollimist lõpule viia (teenus ei pääsenud sellele tagasi ligi). Registreerimine on peatatud."

#: includes/class-babilim-site.php:434
